/P 110 0 R
/E (The system takes a simple bug report as input instead of expecting the user to manually identify the faulty line. The Bug Analyzer first understands the problem and identifies the affected file, function and root cause. The Fix Generator then creates a targeted code correction, which is temporarily applied and tested. The system runs the relevant test as well as regression tests before the Reviewer checks the outcome.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
